\f2\b\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 Level 4 \'97 Know every constraint by heart\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f3\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 You must be able to state any constraint in two seconds when the committee asks.\
Make a set of 15 flashcards. One side: "C14". Other side: "For every slot t and every persona p, persona p is assigned to at most one zone. Written as: for all t,p: |\{z : \uc0\u931 _i x_\{i,z,t,p\} > 0\}| \u8804  1. Reason: an attacker impersonating Finance_DB cannot be in both DMZ and Internal simultaneously \'97 that would be a persona-zone leak."\
Do the same for C1 through C15. Pay special attention to:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0
\f2\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 C4
\f3\b0  \'97 the trap conflict constraint. This is why you cannot have dns_trap and generic_trap in the same slot. It directly limits which techniques you can cover simultaneously.\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 C5
\f3\b0  \'97 the OT air-gap. Only scada_trap can go in OT. This is why scada is in v7f at t=2 \'97 it is the only way to cover pi3h1 (the OT final hop) and T1053/T1203.\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 C8/C13
\f3\b0  \'97 burn feasibility. The requirement \uc0\u916  \u8805  
\f6 \uc0\u8968 
\f3 H/\uc0\u964 _dp0
\f6 \uc0\u8969 
\f3  \uc0\u8722  1 ensures the churn budget is large enough to maintain a burn-free schedule. Violating this makes the problem infeasible.\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 C14
\f3\b0  \'97 persona-zone consistency. This is why Churn=24 is unavoidable \'97 to satisfy C14 with zero burn requires a different (trap, zone) combination every slot for every persona.\
