\f2\b \cf0 \strokec2 What is a honeypot?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f3\b0 \cf0 \strokec2 A honeypot is a 
\f2\b fake safe in the lobby that looks exactly like a real one
\f3\b0 . If an attacker opens it, nothing is stolen \'97 but an alarm goes off and you know exactly what kind of thief you are dealing with (are they after cash? documents? access cards?).\
The question is: 
\f2\b where do you put your fake safes, and when do you rotate them?
\f3\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa319\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf0 \strokec2 What does ZSTP-V6 RC2 do?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f3\b0 \cf0 \strokec2 It solves this placement problem mathematically. It looks at:\
